5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to know why the car is never ready when I need it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of spending evenings untangling who owes what. Let’s look at the time cost.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must understand the true weight of our shared burden before deciding.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I want to see what actually breaks our trust. I’m checking the past conflicts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I need the real numbers. Who is actually driving and paying?,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
