35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The car is often empty or dirty. My weekly clinic trips keep collapsing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The diary shows Saturdays are triple the hours of Tuesdays. Heavy weeks ruin everything.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The fixed costs are 280,000 yen. Other groups failed because they had to ask favours.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,Checking figures made people feel accused. The mechanic says short runs kill the car.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Kenji,,Two people bought half the fuel. One barely drives. The fixed costs are huge.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, if two people drive half, why do I pay the same?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, it’s not just fuel. It’s the time I spend arranging it.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@May, the time is the hidden tax. We must avoid the favour-asking trap.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Servas, exactly. If we check figures, we fight. We need a system that doesn’t require policing.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Takumi, I agree. But I need to know the real cost per person first.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I need a system where the car is ready. No more guessing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,I need to stop spending evenings on admin. A clear schedule is key.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Servas,,We need fairness that doesn’t rely on goodwill. The fixed costs are the baseline.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Takumi,,We need to avoid the resentment of checking. A neutral system is best.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Kenji,,I need the numbers to be clear. No more guesswork on who pays.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
